# Stripe, email

Live FILTER HERO Stripe `acct_1U9bqlQEENEs0Qmw` only.

One shopper message, one sender. Code: `shared/email-channels.ts`.

| Message | Owner |
|---|---|
| Payment receipt | Stripe |
| Order confirmation, quote/support receipt, staff lead alert, back-in-stock one-shot | Resend `Filter Hero <info@filterhero.net>` on `send.filterhero.net` |
| Welcome, abandon, post-purchase, replenish, win-back | Klaviyo. Constant Contact does not send these (FH-380) |
| Filter Clock cadence save | None (staff inbox only) |
| CRM notes / stage changes | None. `CRM_SENDS_MAIL = false` |

Do not send welcome, abandon, replenish, or a second receipt from Resend, Constant Contact, or Successfully Paid. Do not import the mailer from `server/crm/`. Do not subscribe Filter Clock `intent=reminder` to a marketing list.

Native Klaviyo Stripe webhook is charge/invoice only, live FILTER HERO only: `https://a.klaviyo.com/api/webhook/integration/stripe?c=VnVNmQ`. `scrubConflictingStripeWebhooks` deletes that URL on any other Stripe key. Shop Placed Order stays on `https://filterhero.net/api/stripe/webhook`.

Constant Contact stays connected for integrations Klaviyo does not run (its Stripe contact sync, SMS, QuickBooks). The shop token asks only `account_read` and `offline_access`. It has no checkout, abandon, replenish, browse, list, or automation wiring.

Hosted Checkout only. US shipping + phone. Webhook: `checkout.session.completed` + `checkout.session.expired` → `orders.json`. Brand navy `#203868` / burgundy `#7F2328` on Stripe and `shared/email-brand.ts`.
